          "type": "text",
          "text": "Use the data from a community planning study. A task is planned for 10 equally productive workers to complete in 12 days. They all work for 6 days, after which 2 workers leave. Assuming inverse proportion for the remaining divisible work, how many additional days will the remaining workers need? Enter the exact numerical value only."
        }
      ],
